    {
      "id": "t-soxo6z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1796,
      "y": 182,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 210.0,
      "strokeColor": "#232F3E",
      "text": "These checks win\n\nWarn a zone if ETA \u2264 120 min\nand no official order yet.\nUrgent if that ETA \u2264 60 min.\n\nRoad: clear or slow,\nreported in the last 10 min.\nA clear road wins.\n\nCare sites there are named first.\nSmoke with no ETA: health note only.",
